WEBVTT

00:15.847 --> 00:18.207
<b>Why are we...</b>

00:18.687 --> 00:20.387
<b>even alive?</b>

01:57.477 --> 01:59.017
My King, Are You a Bad Person?

01:59.017 --> 02:02.477
Palace has been completed.

02:03.877 --> 02:06.317
<b>It's finally complete!</b>

02:06.317 --> 02:09.657
<b>Yes! The Palace is now complete!</b>

02:15.147 --> 02:17.307
<b>We still have a mountain 
of problems before us,</b>

02:17.307 --> 02:20.877
<b>but this is where our world truly begins.</b>

02:20.877 --> 02:22.327
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

02:22.327 --> 02:25.207
<b>Once we have some leeway, 
let's make it bigger.</b>

02:25.207 --> 02:27.087
<b>I love huge palaces!</b>

02:27.087 --> 02:29.917
<b>I couldn't have said it better, my king!</b>

02:29.917 --> 02:33.487
<b>Our Palace shall pierce the heavens 
and spread roots deep in the land!</b>

02:33.487 --> 02:36.707
<b>The vassals who serve us shall be 
great heroes, both daring and resolute!</b>

02:36.707 --> 02:38.767
<b>The women attending to us shall be countless!</b>

02:38.767 --> 02:41.377
<b>Yeah! I'm getting excited!</b>

02:42.437 --> 02:45.197
<b>I-I just realized something terrible!</b>

02:45.197 --> 02:49.777
<b>We don't have a single attendant 
taking care of you, King Takuto!</b>

02:50.867 --> 02:52.617
<b>Now that you mention it, yeah.</b>

02:52.617 --> 02:54.807
<b>How could I permit such failure?</b>

02:54.807 --> 02:56.577
<b>I've failed you as your servant!</b>

02:56.577 --> 02:58.417
<b>You're going overboard.</b>

02:58.417 --> 03:00.037
<b>I haven't minded it at all.</b>

03:00.037 --> 03:02.317
<b>I'm still concerned about it!</b>

03:02.317 --> 03:03.827
<b>Do you have any requests for one?</b>

03:03.827 --> 03:05.997
<b>Hmm...</b>

03:08.677 --> 03:11.837
<b>S-Someone who's easy to 
talk to would be nice.</b>

03:10.507 --> 03:11.837
<b>Poor Communicator</b>

03:11.837 --> 03:14.847
<b>King Takuto!</b>

03:16.197 --> 03:19.197
<b>I haven't been able to talk 
to the Dark Elves at all,</b>

03:19.197 --> 03:20.937
<b>so I've been feeling really lonely.</b>

03:20.937 --> 03:24.027
<b>I want to try to be a friendlier king.</b>

03:24.027 --> 03:28.817
<b>Well, King Takuto, that's because 
your majesty is a bit too great.</b>

03:29.747 --> 03:31.047
<b>But please don't worry!</b>

03:31.047 --> 03:33.117
<b>I have a brilliant idea.</b>

03:33.117 --> 03:35.197
<b>Would you grant me a little time?</b>

03:35.197 --> 03:39.357
<b><i>Nothing good ever happens when Atou's 
this enthusiastic about something.</i></b>

03:41.607 --> 03:44.997
<b>I have humbly come before you 
in response to your summons.</b>

03:45.357 --> 03:46.847
<b>Elder Moltar!</b>

03:46.847 --> 03:49.847
<b>Gather up all of your little girls!</b>

03:49.847 --> 03:51.257
<b>Our king desires them!</b>

03:51.257 --> 03:52.217
<b>Huh?!</b>

03:53.617 --> 03:57.687
<b>I'll have little girls attend to him to 
help him practice his conversation skills...</b>

03:57.687 --> 03:58.927
<b>What a brilliant idea!</b>

03:58.927 --> 04:01.857
<b>P-Please wait a moment, Lady Atou!</b>

04:01.857 --> 04:04.767
<b>For what reason are you 
issuing such an order?</b>

04:05.257 --> 04:08.437
<b>Because our king likes little girls!</b>

04:12.707 --> 04:14.067
<b>Atou!</b>

04:14.917 --> 04:16.237
<b>Yes?!</b>

04:18.497 --> 04:19.587
<b>Now I understand.</b>

04:19.587 --> 04:23.467
<b>Our king seeks to have an innocent child 
close by to care for his daily needs</b>

04:23.467 --> 04:26.867
<b>so as to remind himself not to 
be shackled by common thinking.</b>

04:26.867 --> 04:28.037
<b>What an impressive mind.</b>

04:28.037 --> 04:29.457
<b>That's true.</b>

04:29.457 --> 04:31.987
<b>Children often spout outlandish ideas,</b>

04:31.987 --> 04:35.007
<b>but occasionally those ideas 
spark revelations in adults.</b>

04:35.497 --> 04:37.207
<b>There's also another reason.</b>

04:37.207 --> 04:41.287
<b>Our king is being thoughtful and trying to 
avoid diverting people away from our labor force.</b>

04:41.287 --> 04:43.887
<b>We're still very short on hands 
at the moment, after all.</b>

04:43.887 --> 04:46.867
<b>Even if it is for our king, it's just 
helping to take care of one's daily needs.</b>

04:46.867 --> 04:50.767
<b>Even a young child is sufficient 
for such simple chores.</b>

04:51.097 --> 04:54.317
<b>Wouldn't a male child 
work just as well, then?</b>

04:54.317 --> 04:56.397
<b>T-That's not the only reason.</b>

04:56.397 --> 04:57.497
<b>Future leadership.</b>

04:57.497 --> 04:59.947
<b>I'll have them study for our future as well.</b>

04:59.947 --> 05:03.097
<b>I'd like to see more opportunities 
for women to excel.</b>

05:03.097 --> 05:04.537
<b>I want this to be a step toward that.</b>

05:05.747 --> 05:06.457
<b>Oh!</b>

05:06.457 --> 05:08.747
<b>To show such deep consideration!</b>

05:10.437 --> 05:11.827
<b><i>Thank goodness.</i></b>

05:11.827 --> 05:14.757
<b><i>That was a desperate excuse, 
but I'm glad they bought it.</i></b>

05:15.117 --> 05:19.747
<b>My, my, our king has shown 
us many great policies.</b>

05:19.747 --> 05:24.207
<b>I'm surprised he's already looking ahead 
toward the nurturing of future talent.</b>

05:24.207 --> 05:25.767
<b>Our king is impressive!</b>

05:26.957 --> 05:28.597
<b>I'm not that great.</b>

05:28.597 --> 05:30.067
<b>Our discussion is over.</b>

05:30.067 --> 05:32.347
<b>Now, bring us your children!</b>

05:32.347 --> 05:33.607
<b>I'm counting on you!</b>

05:34.187 --> 05:35.097
<b><i>All right!</i></b>

05:35.097 --> 05:37.647
<b><i>Now to work hard on curing 
my poor communication!</i></b>

05:45.447 --> 05:49.787
<b>M-My king, it's just children being children.</b>

05:50.117 --> 05:52.147
<b>Our king is pouting!</b>

05:52.147 --> 05:54.757
<b>Are there no children who won't 
cry at the sight of our king?!</b>

05:55.647 --> 05:59.287
<b>My sincere apologies. This 
is all of our children.</b>

05:59.287 --> 06:00.387
<b>Weaklings!</b>

06:00.387 --> 06:01.597
<b>They're weaklings!</b>

06:02.247 --> 06:05.347
<b>Elder Moltar, did you allow 
those twins an audience too?</b>

06:05.347 --> 06:07.587
<b>N-No...</b>

06:07.587 --> 06:10.557
<b>Bringing those children before 
the king would be rude.</b>

06:11.867 --> 06:13.187
<b>What is this about?</b>

06:13.187 --> 06:14.967
<b>How should I describe it?</b>

06:14.967 --> 06:18.037
<b>There is a pair of twin 
girls without any family.</b>

06:18.037 --> 06:21.697
<b>They certainly are sensible girls, 
but there's a slight issue.</b>

06:22.277 --> 06:26.447
<b>I believe they would be
inappropriate as our king's attendants.</b>

06:26.837 --> 06:29.337
<b>Wouldn't wise children be a perfect fit?</b>

06:29.337 --> 06:32.787
<b>Well, regardless, we'll see 
them and decide for ourselves.</b>

06:32.787 --> 06:33.917
<b>Please bring them here.</b>

06:35.537 --> 06:37.547
<b>I've already brought them here.</b>

06:37.547 --> 06:40.627
<b>Gia! You work fast, don't you?!</b>

06:41.537 --> 06:43.137
<b>Unlike our aging elders,</b>

06:43.137 --> 06:46.837
<b>I'm always thinking two or 
three steps ahead for our king.</b>

06:46.837 --> 06:48.887
<b>You little whippersnapper!</b>

06:49.147 --> 06:52.167
<b>Now, now, please don't fight.</b>

06:52.167 --> 06:56.227
<b>Now then, please summon the twins at once.</b>

06:56.567 --> 06:57.247
<b>Yes!</b>

07:04.627 --> 07:07.807
<b>It's a pleasure to meet you, 
great and mighty king.</b>

07:07.807 --> 07:10.747
<b>I am called Caria Elfuur.</b>

07:11.047 --> 07:12.617
<b>I'm her big sister.</b>

07:14.637 --> 07:18.417
<b>My big sister is Maria Elfuur.</b>

07:18.417 --> 07:21.127
<b>N-Nice to meet you.</b>

07:22.197 --> 07:24.757
<b>They do seem to be children 
with a grim history.</b>

07:28.107 --> 07:31.667
<b>You there, how did you get those sores?</b>

07:31.667 --> 07:33.227
<b>From a disease.</b>

07:33.627 --> 07:35.357
<b>Poor girl!</b>

07:35.357 --> 07:36.567
<b>My king,</b>

07:36.567 --> 07:39.227
<b>this is what I deserve.</b>

07:39.567 --> 07:41.727
<b>Allow me to explain for her.</b>

07:41.727 --> 07:44.017
<b>The sores were caused by a plague,</b>

07:44.017 --> 07:47.027
<b>and even though she's completely 
recovered from it, that scar remains.</b>

07:48.237 --> 07:50.827
<b>And what about your big sister?</b>

07:51.417 --> 07:54.997
<b>My big sister went through 
something very cruel.</b>

07:55.667 --> 07:56.957
<b>Something cruel?</b>

07:58.217 --> 08:00.297
<b>I ate Mom.</b>

08:04.047 --> 08:05.047
<b>Moltar?</b>

08:07.307 --> 08:09.967
<b>It was a hard decision.</b>

08:09.967 --> 08:13.407
<b>Their mother was a woman to be proud of.</b>

08:13.407 --> 08:18.147
<b>Our clan has never forgotten 
the sacrifice she made for us.</b>

08:19.367 --> 08:20.567
<b><i>Right...</i></b>

08:21.307 --> 08:24.447
<b><i>They traveled long and far after 
being driven from their homes.</i></b>

08:26.457 --> 08:30.467
<b><i>Of course that meant trials forcing 
extreme decisions on them too.</i></b>

08:30.467 --> 08:33.497
<b><i>One of which was starvation.</i></b>

08:37.657 --> 08:41.547
<b><i>The fact that they have the courage 
not to cower is appealing, but...</i></b>

08:46.637 --> 08:49.047
<b>My king, you're white!</b>

08:50.187 --> 08:51.767
<b>How so?</b>

08:52.077 --> 08:54.727
<b>Hmm, I'm not sure.</b>

08:55.167 --> 08:57.167
<b>Maria, was it?</b>

08:57.167 --> 08:59.377
<b>Are you willing to take care of me?</b>

08:59.377 --> 09:02.147
<b>Yeah! I'll take care of you, my king!</b>

09:02.147 --> 09:04.737
<b>It might be hard, with a lot to learn,</b>

09:04.737 --> 09:05.737
<b>but will you do your best?</b>

09:06.897 --> 09:09.237
<b>I think I can.</b>

09:09.757 --> 09:14.117
<b>Then starting today, you're a candidate 
for the leadership of our great Mynoghra.</b>

09:14.247 --> 09:16.327
<b><i>O-Our king!</i></b>

09:16.327 --> 09:20.627
<b><i>Our king is a having a proper 
conversation with a little girl!</i></b>

09:21.047 --> 09:22.747
<b>You aren't afraid?</b>

09:23.597 --> 09:30.707
<b>A-As her little sister, I have a 
duty to stay with my big sister.</b>

09:30.707 --> 09:34.017
<b>If that's what Big Sis wants,</b>

09:34.017 --> 09:36.727
<b>then I'll do my best alongside her.</b>

09:36.727 --> 09:37.997
<b>That's good.</b>

09:37.997 --> 09:39.527
<b>That's very good of you.</b>

09:39.527 --> 09:41.567
<b>Then you'll stay with us too?</b>

09:41.567 --> 09:43.527
<b>Y-You can count on me!</b>

09:45.897 --> 09:48.157
<b>Our king has granted his permission.</b>

09:48.157 --> 09:52.657
<b>From now on, these two shall 
work to take care of our king.</b>

09:53.567 --> 09:56.157
<b>I'll be counting on you two.</b>

09:59.477 --> 10:02.417
<b>My king, there's something you should know.</b>

10:02.417 --> 10:03.467
<b>What is it?</b>

10:04.347 --> 10:06.007
<b>To be honest,</b>

10:07.107 --> 10:11.427
<b>those two haven't cried even 
once since losing their mother.</b>

10:12.487 --> 10:13.597
<b>What do you mean?</b>

10:13.937 --> 10:16.737
<b>Their hearts remain closed off.</b>

10:16.737 --> 10:21.187
<b>I beg you to watch over them 
with tolerance and mercy.</b>

10:30.327 --> 10:32.787
<b>My king, your drink.</b>

10:32.787 --> 10:33.527
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:36.417 --> 10:37.367
<b>I spilled it.</b>

10:37.867 --> 10:40.127
<b>I-It's all right.</b>

10:41.747 --> 10:45.207
<b>K-King! I'll wipe your clothing!</b>

10:46.727 --> 10:48.127
<b>T-Thanks.</b>

10:49.167 --> 10:50.547
<b>Again?</b>

10:51.767 --> 10:53.047
<b>Now, now.</b>

10:54.507 --> 10:57.037
<b>Anyway, we have a meeting now.</b>

10:57.037 --> 10:58.737
<b>You two will attend as well.</b>

10:58.737 --> 11:00.137
<b>Try to avoid any blunders.</b>

11:00.527 --> 11:02.247
<b>Let's go, then.</b>

11:02.247 --> 11:03.307
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:04.647 --> 11:07.817
<b>Now, it's time for our fun domestic affairs.</b>

11:08.137 --> 11:10.697
<b>We'll start with reports 
on our current situation.</b>

11:10.697 --> 11:11.657
<b>Construction manager?</b>

11:11.657 --> 11:14.657
<b>Yes, I'm Emle, the one in 
charge of construction.</b>

11:15.277 --> 11:19.217
<b>Now that we have completed the 
Palace, we have some labor to spare.</b>

11:19.217 --> 11:21.127
<b>Our supply of lumber remains steady,</b>

11:21.127 --> 11:22.687
<b>so we have plenty of resources too.</b>

11:22.687 --> 11:25.537
<b>I believe we can start 
work on a new facility.</b>

11:25.537 --> 11:26.967
<b>I see.</b>

11:26.967 --> 11:28.467
<b>Then King Takuto,</b>

11:28.467 --> 11:32.567
<b>are we good to proceed with the next 
Building we discussed last meeting?</b>

11:32.567 --> 11:33.277
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:33.277 --> 11:34.387
<b>Then, Emle,</b>

11:34.387 --> 11:36.597
<b>please start construction of the Clinic next.</b>

11:37.207 --> 11:40.747
<b><i>The Clinic guarantees the health 
and safety of our citizens</i></b>

11:40.747 --> 11:42.497
<b><i>and it has a low building cost,</i></b>

11:42.497 --> 11:44.057
<b><i>so it's the best option at present.</i></b>

11:44.477 --> 11:45.767
<b>As you command.</b>

11:45.767 --> 11:48.007
<b>I'll convey that to the 
one in charge of the work.</b>

11:48.007 --> 11:52.007
<b>Next is the state of our 
Resources. Who's in charge?</b>

11:52.007 --> 11:52.757
<b>Oh!</b>

11:53.177 --> 11:54.657
<b>Th-That's me!</b>

11:55.047 --> 11:57.277
<b>We really are lacking staff.</b>

11:57.587 --> 12:00.447
<b>I'm also in charge of Resources.</b>

12:00.447 --> 12:04.037
<b>Our domestic collection of Food and 
Materials is proceeding smoothly.</b>

12:04.357 --> 12:05.687
<b>With the aid of our king,</b>

12:05.687 --> 12:09.357
<b>we're also able to provide the 
daily necessities we can't produce.</b>

12:09.357 --> 12:12.077
<b>However, since that still consumes Mana,</b>

12:12.077 --> 12:15.087
<b>our balance between input and 
output is a little poor there.</b>

12:15.457 --> 12:19.527
<b>Using Mana on Emergency Production 
is just too convenient, isn't it?</b>

12:19.527 --> 12:23.097
<b>Still, it's a necessary expense, 
so we'll keep using it.</b>

12:23.547 --> 12:29.127
<b>We'll want to prioritize Buildings and 
Research that increase the production of Mana.</b>

12:29.127 --> 12:30.607
<b>Good work managing that too.</b>

12:31.097 --> 12:32.627
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

12:33.207 --> 12:37.567
<b>Now that the topic of Mana has come 
up, let's discuss our Research.</b>

12:38.267 --> 12:41.647
<b>We've completed Research on Military Magic.</b>

12:41.647 --> 12:44.167
<b>I'm the only one capable 
of using it at present,</b>

12:44.167 --> 12:47.667
<b>but my subordinates will eventually 
be able to use it with more training.</b>

12:47.997 --> 12:52.897
<b>I believe that casting powerful magic with 
the Ruin Mana being provided by the Palace</b>

12:52.897 --> 12:54.927
<b>will be crucial for our future!</b>

12:55.287 --> 13:00.807
<b>Though, given our king's policies, I 
doubt we'll be using it very proactively.</b>

13:01.137 --> 13:02.757
<b>That's true.</b>

13:02.757 --> 13:05.367
<b>Ruin's military magic is quite useful,</b>

13:05.367 --> 13:08.677
<b>but it has absolutely no 
use in domestic affairs.</b>

13:10.027 --> 13:11.357
<b>For our Research,</b>

13:11.687 --> 13:15.927
<b>let's also proceed as planned and move on to 
the Six Major Elements in the Magic Tree.</b>

13:15.927 --> 13:19.367
<b>There isn't much merit to be had 
from researching anything else yet.</b>

13:19.867 --> 13:22.247
<b><i>It does mean we'll be slanted towards magic,</i></b>

13:22.247 --> 13:24.287
<b><i>but specializing in a particular field</i></b>

13:24.287 --> 13:26.957
<b><i>is an orthodox national strategy.</i></b>

13:27.287 --> 13:29.207
<b>Lastly, that brings us to our military.</b>

13:30.987 --> 13:34.587
<b>Head Warrior Gia reporting in.</b>

13:34.587 --> 13:38.177
<b>We have a total of five new Long-legged 
Bugs added to our forces.</b>

13:39.017 --> 13:44.177
<b>They are primarily out surveying the 
uncharted territory surrounding the Accursed Lands.</b>

13:44.487 --> 13:48.687
<b>However, unlike inside the Accursed Lands, 
the land beyond the forest is all plains.</b>

13:49.207 --> 13:51.287
<b>We're focused on maintaining stealth,</b>

13:51.287 --> 13:54.397
<b>so we're currently unable to 
make any bold investigations.</b>

13:54.397 --> 14:00.007
<b>Good. Our king has been given a detailed 
report about our surroundings.</b>

14:00.007 --> 14:01.777
<b>Considering our need for stealth,</b>

14:01.777 --> 14:04.947
<b>please have the Long-legged Bugs 
assigned to patrolling our periphery.</b>

14:04.947 --> 14:07.077
<b>You want me to put all of them on that, then?</b>

14:07.517 --> 14:11.327
<b>I'm sufficient for defending 
our nation for the time being.</b>

14:11.757 --> 14:14.087
<b>You witnessed it for yourself, didn't you?</b>

14:15.907 --> 14:16.667
<b>Yes!</b>

14:16.937 --> 14:21.307
<b>Furthermore, we've officially 
decided to produce a new Hero.</b>

14:23.387 --> 14:26.557
<b>I'm planning to summon 
Isla, Queen of Bugs.</b>

14:29.147 --> 14:33.157
<b>How are we doing on the Resources 
necessary to produce Isla?</b>

14:33.157 --> 14:35.937
<b>I'll give the report on that.</b>

14:36.567 --> 14:39.877
<b>We've already secured enough 
lumber and rations for it,</b>

14:39.877 --> 14:43.237
<b>and we've finished transporting 
them to the ritual site.</b>

14:43.677 --> 14:46.677
<b><i>That means Mana is all that's left.</i></b>

15:02.867 --> 15:05.377
<b>That concludes today's agenda.</b>

15:05.957 --> 15:07.717
<b>King Takuto, what do you think?</b>

15:08.167 --> 15:09.937
<b>I have no issues with our plans.</b>

15:09.937 --> 15:12.047
<b>You're all doing incredibly well.</b>

15:15.107 --> 15:20.697
New Production and Research has been chosen.

15:15.107 --> 15:20.697
Building! Clinic

15:15.107 --> 15:20.697
Researching! Six Major Elements

15:15.107 --> 15:20.697
Producing! Isla, Queen of Bugs

15:27.867 --> 15:29.697
<b>I ran into you.</b>

15:30.497 --> 15:31.957
<b>W-We're sorry!</b>

15:38.647 --> 15:39.827
<b>Ah...</b>

15:39.827 --> 15:41.047
<b>We tore it...</b>

15:43.717 --> 15:45.047
<b>It's all right.</b>

15:50.627 --> 15:51.757
<b>King...</b>

15:51.757 --> 15:52.187
<b>Hmm?</b>

15:52.727 --> 15:54.907
<b>My king, are you a bad person?</b>

15:54.907 --> 15:56.687
<b>Well, my alignment is evil.</b>

15:57.287 --> 15:58.897
<b>Then why aren't you killing?</b>

16:00.107 --> 16:01.267
<b>Killing who?</b>

16:02.157 --> 16:03.507
<b>Us.</b>

16:03.507 --> 16:04.197
<b>Huh?</b>

16:04.557 --> 16:07.077
<b>U-Uh, well, my king,</b>

16:07.077 --> 16:12.077
<b>my big sister is asking why 
our great and mighty king</b>

16:12.077 --> 16:14.827
<b>is showing children like us such mercy.</b>

16:17.107 --> 16:19.127
<b>B-Because you're taking care of me?</b>

16:20.167 --> 16:25.467
<b>Big Sis is mad that you're being 
so kind when you're a bad person.</b>

16:25.467 --> 16:27.157
<b>Uh...</b>

16:27.157 --> 16:28.317
<b>Hmm...</b>

16:29.207 --> 16:31.047
<b>Let me tell you about something!</b>

16:31.047 --> 16:32.177
<b>Listen well, okay?</b>

16:33.557 --> 16:34.907
<b>A good person</b>

16:34.907 --> 16:37.327
<b>is only allowed to do what's right.</b>

16:37.327 --> 16:39.287
<b>They can't hurt others,</b>

16:39.287 --> 16:41.657
<b>and they can't steal things 
from others either.</b>

16:41.657 --> 16:43.567
<b>Murdering people is out of the question.</b>

16:43.567 --> 16:44.647
<b>Yeah!</b>

16:44.647 --> 16:45.987
<b>Naturally.</b>

16:45.987 --> 16:47.687
<b>Then what about a bad person?</b>

16:47.687 --> 16:49.117
<b>What do you think they should do?</b>

16:49.407 --> 16:51.497
<b>They have to do bad things!</b>

16:51.497 --> 16:53.367
<b>They commit heinous atrocities!</b>

16:53.367 --> 16:54.437
<b>You're wrong.</b>

16:54.437 --> 16:56.137
<b>They're allowed to do anything!</b>

16:57.067 --> 17:00.737
<b>They can do good things, and 
they can do bad things too.</b>

17:00.737 --> 17:02.487
<b>You see, bad people</b>

17:02.487 --> 17:04.667
<b>are very selfish and free.</b>

17:04.977 --> 17:07.767
<b>They're allowed to believe 
in what they think is right</b>

17:07.767 --> 17:09.587
<b>and ignore what others think</b>

17:09.587 --> 17:12.047
<b>as they press on without looking back.</b>

17:12.047 --> 17:13.847
<b>That's what an evil person truly is.</b>

17:14.427 --> 17:17.307
<b>So it's perfectly fine for 
me to be kind to you two!</b>

17:17.307 --> 17:18.937
<b>That's unfair!</b>

17:19.277 --> 17:20.597
<b>Of course it is.</b>

17:20.597 --> 17:22.277
<b>I'm a bad person, after all.</b>

17:23.097 --> 17:24.857
<b>Won't you be punished one day?</b>

17:25.147 --> 17:28.197
<b>If I kill the good person who
comes to punish me first,</b>

17:28.197 --> 17:29.767
<b>then I won't be.</b>

17:29.767 --> 17:31.047
<b>What?!</b>

17:33.677 --> 17:35.957
<b>You messed up on purpose all 
those times, didn't you?</b>

17:38.397 --> 17:41.347
<b>Big Sis and I...</b>

17:41.347 --> 17:42.957
<b>...should have died.</b>

17:43.847 --> 17:44.877
<b>I see.</b>

17:45.447 --> 17:47.337
<b>But you're afraid of death?</b>

17:51.527 --> 17:55.327
<b><i>They can't forgive themselves for surviving 
due to their mother's death.</i></b>

17:55.327 --> 17:57.337
<b><i>So they're seeking salvation through death.</i></b>

17:58.387 --> 18:01.767
<b><i>I guess they thought that if they 
did things to anger their king,</i></b>

18:01.767 --> 18:05.097
<b><i>then I would kill them as punishment.</i></b>

18:10.767 --> 18:14.537
<b>You two are here now for a reason.</b>

18:14.537 --> 18:17.647
<b>You're here because someone did what 
they had to for you to survive.</b>

18:17.647 --> 18:20.077
<b>You understand who that was, don't you?</b>

18:21.547 --> 18:22.997
<b>But it's painful.</b>

18:24.037 --> 18:25.707
<b>It hurts.</b>

18:26.457 --> 18:29.257
<b>What did your mother say to you?</b>

18:31.057 --> 18:32.357
<b>"Live on."</b>

18:33.607 --> 18:36.817
<b>Doing bad things isn't always wrong.</b>

18:36.817 --> 18:39.727
<b>Both of you and your mother</b>

18:39.727 --> 18:41.347
<b>did the right thing.</b>

18:41.877 --> 18:43.147
<b>Be proud.</b>

18:43.147 --> 18:47.987
<b>You two are still here because your 
mother's love triumphed over fate.</b>

18:48.967 --> 18:51.907
<b>My king, what are we...</b>

18:52.427 --> 18:54.777
<b>What are we supposed to do now?!</b>

18:58.617 --> 19:01.137
<b>You should live your lives as you please.</b>

19:01.137 --> 19:04.067
<b>So your mother's love will be rewarded,</b>

19:04.067 --> 19:06.497
<b>and so your mother can be proud of you.</b>

19:07.197 --> 19:08.777
<b>Remember this.</b>

19:08.777 --> 19:10.917
<b>You two are free.</b>

19:10.917 --> 19:12.527
<b>You're free to do anything,</b>

19:12.527 --> 19:15.017
<b>and you don't have to do 
anything for forgiveness.</b>

19:15.017 --> 19:18.647
<b>So long as you behave in a way 
your mother would be proud of,</b>

19:18.647 --> 19:21.267
<b>then I'll praise everything about you.</b>

19:24.237 --> 19:26.607
<b>You don't have to hold it in.</b>

19:42.267 --> 19:45.307
<b>King Takuto, our investigation is—</b>

19:44.007 --> 19:45.307
<b>Shh!</b>

19:46.907 --> 19:49.567
<b>You've grown awfully close to them.</b>

19:49.567 --> 19:52.217
<b>Yeah, we have grown closer.</b>

19:54.637 --> 19:56.217
<b>More importantly, your report!</b>

19:56.217 --> 19:58.187
<b>Oh, pardon me.</b>

19:58.187 --> 20:00.167
<b>It's about that city.</b>

20:00.167 --> 20:01.937
<b>Shall we go somewhere else?</b>

20:05.317 --> 20:12.247
<b>It's a city of Forngawn, a neutral, multiracial 
nation composed primarily of humans and beastmen.</b>

20:12.247 --> 20:15.317
<b>Apparently, the city is named Dragontan.</b>

20:15.647 --> 20:17.837
<b>The nation uses a parliamentary system</b>

20:17.837 --> 20:21.787
<b>run by shamans known as "Staff Holders."</b>

20:21.787 --> 20:26.377
<b>A multiracial nation will incorporate 
several cultures and ideologies,</b>

20:26.377 --> 20:28.087
<b>so diplomacy should be promising.</b>

20:28.087 --> 20:28.627
<b>Yes.</b>

20:29.127 --> 20:32.107
<b>Though this is a rather remote city.</b>

20:32.107 --> 20:34.987
<b>I wonder why they built a 
city in a place like this?</b>

20:34.987 --> 20:38.487
<b>It would cost a great deal to ensure 
trade and distribution of goods out here.</b>

20:38.487 --> 20:42.727
<b>I do have something to report on that front.</b>

20:43.207 --> 20:46.597
<b>It would seem there's a Dragon 
Vein Mine within the city.</b>

20:47.897 --> 20:48.817
<b>Oh?</b>

20:49.207 --> 20:52.657
<b>A Dragon Vein Mine is 
capable of producing Mana,</b>

20:52.657 --> 20:55.107
<b>so I believe we should 
secure it as best we can.</b>

20:55.107 --> 21:00.157
<b>Also, it seems Dragontan is currently 
in a state of high alert.</b>

21:01.857 --> 21:04.087
<b>We were only able to observe from afar,</b>

21:04.087 --> 21:08.507
<b>but we confirmed attacks from 
Barbarians like Ogres and Goblins.</b>

21:08.507 --> 21:11.667
<b>They seemed to be struggling 
desperately to respond to them.</b>

21:12.027 --> 21:14.637
<b>Do you think they'll get 
reinforcements from their homeland?</b>

21:14.637 --> 21:17.267
<b>There were none in the regions 
we were able to observe.</b>

21:17.267 --> 21:19.557
<b>The city is in rather detached lands,</b>

21:19.557 --> 21:21.637
<b>so they probably can't 
send any reinforcements.</b>

21:21.967 --> 21:24.327
<b>If they're under attack,</b>

21:24.327 --> 21:26.597
<b>there's a chance 
they're generating refugees.</b>

21:26.597 --> 21:27.747
<b>Yes.</b>

21:27.747 --> 21:30.127
<b>If we're able to welcome them in,</b>

21:30.127 --> 21:32.277
<b>then we might be able to 
increase our population.</b>

21:32.737 --> 21:34.377
<b>And if we help them,</b>

21:34.377 --> 21:36.357
<b>then even the Dragon Vein Mine...</b>

21:37.057 --> 21:39.067
<b>Then for our next turn...</b>

21:40.197 --> 21:43.447
<b>We're dispatching diplomats to 
the neutral nation of Forngawn!</b>

23:30.927 --> 23:33.767
<b>You're not human, are you?</b>

23:36.737 --> 23:38.407
<b>Correct.</b>
